<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 24.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zheng Xing Hai 3,003,000 cu ft USG/Rotterdam 5-10/10 $490,000 11 days shex Bunge.</p>
<p>Full Strong 50,000 grains 1-7/10 USG/Acaba $16.75 five days 3,000 Continental Grain.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
